    "updated_at": "2017-10-10T19:43:01Z",
    "body": "> This would be a significant breaking change, IMO\r\n\r\nMy understanding is that the OP is proposing aligning with what is implemented. So are you saying that implementing the spec would be a significant breaking change from whats implemented, and thus we should fix the spec?\r\n\r\nOr are you saying that the spec changing to match implementations would be a breaking change on the spec side? If so, why would that matter?\r\n\r\nOr is my understanding that the OP's proposal is to align with what's implemented, incorrect?",
