    "updated_at": "2017-10-10T20:30:27Z",
    "body": "I'm saying we should fix implementations to match the spec.  I've been working to do so in firefox for the last 6 months and close to achieving it.\r\n\r\nAnd at least in firefox workers do not inherit CSP from the owner.\r\n\r\nAnd as I have commented elsewhere in this issue I am opposed to creating a global as a subresource on conceptual grounds.  Lets not create more weird exceptions in the platform.",
