    "body": "FWIW, I noticed that firefox has been treating worker script loads as non-subresource as they relate to service workers for some time.  See the first case in:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/w3c/web-platform-tests/blob/master/service-workers/service-worker/worker-interception.https.html\r\n\r\nAFAICT this was written 2 years ago as part of:\r\n\r\nhttps://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1184798\r\nhttps://hg.mozilla.org/mozilla-central/rev/5061c446e169\r\n\r\nEdit: Current browser behavior on this test:\r\n\r\nhttps://wpt.fyi/service-workers/service-worker/worker-interception.https.html",
